{
    "lesson": 143,
    "title": [
        "A walk through the woods",
        "林中散步"
    ],
    "content": {
        "sentences": [
            [
                "I live in a very old town which is surrounded by beautiful woods.",
                "我住在一个由美丽的树林环绕的古老的小镇上。"
            ],
            [
                "It is a famous beauty spot.",
                "这是一个著名的风景胜地。"
            ],
            [
                "On Sundays, hundreds of people come from the city to see our town.",
                "每逢星期天，有许许多人从城里来观赏我们的小镇。"
            ],
            [
                "And to walk through the woods.",
                "并在树林中散步。"
            ],
            [
                "Visitors have been asked to keep the woods clean and tidy.",
                "游客已被告知要保持树林的整洁。"
            ],
            [
                "Litter baskets have been placed under the trees, but people still throw their rubbish everywhere.",
                "树下都已设置了废物筐，但是人们仍到处扔垃圾。"
            ],
            [
                "Last Wednesday, I went for a walk in the woods.",
                "上星期三我到树林里去散步。"
            ],
            [
                "What I saw made me very sad.",
                "我所见到的一切使我非常难过。"
            ],
            [
                "I counted seven old cars and three old refrigerators.",
                "我数了一下，有7辆旧汽车和3台旧冰箱。"
            ],
            [
                "The little baskets were empty.",
                "废物筐是空的。"
            ],
            [
                "The ground was covered with pieces of paper, cigarette ends.",
                "而满地都是纸片、烟头。"
            ],
            [
                "Old tyres, empty bottles and rusty tins.",
                "旧轮胎，空瓶子和生锈的空罐头盒。"
            ],
            [
                "Among the rubbish, I found a sign.",
                "在垃圾堆中我发现了一块牌子。"
            ],
            [
                "It said, 'Anyone who leaves litter in these woods will be prosecuted!'",
                "上面写着：「凡在此树林里丢弃垃圾者，将依法处置！」"
            ]
        ]
    },
